      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-250, -180],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### AI Job Guide — Job Expiry Sweep\nHourly Schedule Trigger → Workflow Configuration → Expire Due Jobs (calls public.expire_due_jobs(), see supabase/migrations/20260930160000_add_model_c_active_capacity_and_daily_limits.sql). Idempotent, set-based, never deletes rows, only ever transitions active -> expired for jobs whose expires_at/closing_date has passed (tests/db/job-expiry-sweep.test.mjs). PREPARED ONLY — stays `active: false` until an explicit, separate production authorization (see job-expiry-sweep.ts header for the exact activation steps). Requires the same 'Supabase Service Role' credential as cv-analysis-worker.ts.",
